@@ -0,0 +1,8 @@
+# Plan
+
+1. Change cart hydration in `ShoppingCartServiceImpl` to remove line items whose SKU no longer resolves, remove their cart attributes, persist the surviving items, and keep the cart valid even when no items remain. Recompute the obsolete state only for existing cart rules, not for deleted products.
+2. Make cart retrieval use the merchant store consistently and ensure cart mapping/calculation sees only surviving, fully populated items. Verify empty carts report no products, quantity zero, and zero subtotal/total.
+3. Harden the cart add and multi-add paths so every missing/deleted SKU produces `ResourceNotFoundException` (HTTP 404), and ensure checkout never receives deleted items.
+4. Verify order product response mapping uses persisted snapshot fields even when live product lookup returns null, including all private/authenticated single and list order paths and unchanged order totals/status updates.
+5. Verify the v2 SKU lookup remains a 404 for deleted products and that deletion does not affect unrelated products.
+6. Add focused regression tests where the existing test structure permits, then run targeted Maven tests and the relevant module/build checks; inspect the final diff for unrelated changes.
